# AI Integration & OpenAI Service Patterns

## OpenAI Service Architecture
- Use [ai_service](mdc:backend/src/services/ai_service/__init__.py) for all operations
- Implement async and sync versions
- Check `is_ai_enabled()` before operations
- Log all usage with [ai_usage_service.py](mdc:backend/src/services/ai_ops/ai_usage_service.py)

## Key Responsibilities
- CV parsing with structured prompts
- Job fit analysis and scoring
- Content generation tailored to jobs
- Error handling with fallbacks

## Background Task Processing
- Use ThreadPoolExecutor for AI processing
- Use SessionLocal() in background threads, close in finally blocks
- Update task status in database, log errors with context

## Error Handling & Resilience
- Handle API rate limits and timeouts
- Exponential backoff (max 3 retries, 2^attempt seconds)
- Provide fallback responses, return structured error objects

## Prompt Engineering
- Clear, structured prompts with JSON output format
- Request JSON-only responses, specify required fields
- Test with various inputs, keep in service layer

## Security & Privacy
- Sanitize inputs before AI processing
- Don't log sensitive data, use secure API key management
- Never expose API keys to frontend
